SUMMARY:Moth Madness & Movie Night (Chapel Hill)
DESCRIPTION:Visit NCWF Tri-County Conservationists Chapter at Moth Madness and Movie Night at the Chapel Hill Public Library! The evening will begin with a screening of The Extraordinary Caterpillar which explores the ecological role of caterpillars. After the film\, participants will migrate outside for crafts\, games\, and activities with local environmental organizations in addition to moth night viewing in the park! Join us for an event celebrating our moth friends! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/moth-madness-movie-night-chapel-hill/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
